        },
        "faq_Eb44T8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "9. Can I take it with other supplements or medications?",
            "answer": "<p>In most cases, yes. Cell Renew pairs well with most vitamins, adaptogens, and hormone-supportive supplements. If you are taking prescription medications, hormone therapy, or managing a medical condition, consult your healthcare provider before use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_YaakAD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "10. Can I take it if I’m pregnant or breastfeeding?",
            "answer": "<p>If you are pregnant, planning to become pregnant, or breastfeeding, speak with your doctor before using Cell Renew Tonic.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3CWMLC": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "11. What if I miss a day?",
            "answer": "<p>Just resume the next day. While consistency brings the best results, missing a day now and then will not interfere with your progress.</p>"
